+            "cells unrun: MERLIN_TOPK_LARGE_FAULT_INJECT is not armed, so the "
+            "group-uniform fail-closed path is not exercised. A skip is not a "
+            "pass; run this test in its own process with the variable set to a "
+            "NONZERO CTA index."
